    "flavor_text_entries": [
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il creuse les arbres à raison de seize coups de bec par seconde. Le trou creusé lui sert ensuite à stocker des provisions ou à faire son nid.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It can peck at a rate of 16 times a second to drill holes in trees. It uses the holes for food storage and for nesting.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "秒間１６連打　で　木を　突き 穴を　ほる。　開けた　穴は　餌を 仕舞う　貯蔵庫や　巣に　使う。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il se nourrit essentiellement de fruits, dont il conserve les pépins dans son bec pour en canarder ses ennemis, telle une mitraillette.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "This Pokémon feeds on berries, whose leftover seeds become the ammunition for the attacks it fires off from its mouth.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "きのみが　餌。　喰らった後の タネを　弾として　口から 発射し　攻撃に　利用。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "On peut deviner son état d’esprit et de santé en étudiant le rythme auquel il tape contre les arbres avec son bec dur.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It pecks at trees with its hard beak. You can get some idea of its mood or condition from the rhythm of its pecking.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "硬いクチバシで　樹木を　つつく。 つつくリズムで　そのときの　機嫌や 体調も　なんとなく　わかる。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Son cou fin renferme des muscles étonnamment puissants. Il tape contre les arbres à raison de seize coups de bec par seconde.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It may look spindly, but its neck muscles are heavy-duty. It can peck at a tree 16 times per second!",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "細く　見えるが　強靭な 首の　筋肉を持つ。　秒間 １６連打で　木を　突きまくるぞ。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      }
